+/*
+ * Capability strings reach tparm_setup as the same pointers every time (the
+ * terminfo entry owns them), but the format cache is a tree keyed by strcmp:
+ * ~log2(formats) string compares per call, on every colour and cursor move.
+ * A direct-mapped cache keyed by the string's address skips the walk.  A hit
+ * is confirmed with one strcmp against the cached format, so a freed and
+ * reused address still yields the right entry.
